# detail
Number of changes: 1

1. Modified | Implementation code block
   Replaced multiple direct calls to `tick` attributes and methods with a single call to `_tick_update_position(tick, tickxs, tickys, labelpos)`.
   The original implementation included:
   * Method calls: set the positions of `label1` and `label2`;
   * Method calls: set the visibility of `tick1line` and `tick2line`;
   * Method calls: set the line style, marker, and data of `tick1line`;
   * Method call: set the data of `gridline`.

   The new implementation includes:
   * Function call: call `_tick_update_position` with `tick`, `tickxs`, `tickys`, and `labelpos`.
